      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the rhetorical question inviting response",
      "description": "The meme uses the text 'what's your response?' to directly address the viewer, projecting the user onto the rhetorical question. This invites the user to imagine themselves as the one responding, thereby engaging them in the meme's provocative framing. The user is not projected onto a visual or scene element, but onto the textual material that demands a reaction.",
