      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target community is individuals who identify with or support the political opposition to Democratic Representative Marcia Fudge, specifically those who are politically aligned with Donald Trump and his supporters. The meme is designed to provoke outrage or agreement among those who perceive her statements as racially charged and inflammatory, leveraging the accusation of 'racist' to vilify her political stance. This audience is likely politically conservative, particularly those who view the 2016 election as a defining moment of political division and who are sensitive to accusations of racism against political opponents. The meme's rhetorical question 'what's your response?' is a direct call to action for this community to react emotionally or politically to the portrayal of the representative.",
